tices for Using WebSockets in Web3\",\"path\":\"/reference/best-practices-for-using-websockets-in-web3\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"How to use websockets when building on Ethereum, Polygon, Optimism, and Arbitrum.\"},{\"title\":\"Subscription API Endpoints\",\"path\":\"/reference/subscription-api-endpoints\",\"type\":\"section\",\"children\":[{\"title\":\"alchemy_minedTransactions\",\"path\":\"/reference/alchemy-minedtransactions\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Emits full transaction objects or hashes that are mined on the network based on provided filters and block tags.\"},{\"title\":\"alchemy_pendingTransactions\",\"path\":\"/reference/alchemy-pendingtransactions\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Emits full transaction objects or hashes that are sent to the network, marked as pending, based on provided filters.\"},{\"title\":\"newPendingTransactions\",\"path\":\"/reference/newpendingtransactions\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Emits transaction hashes that are sent to the network and marked as \\\\pending\\\\.\"},{\"title\":\"newHeads\",\"path\":\"/reference/newheads\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Emits new blocks that are added to the blockchain.\"},{\"title\":\"logs\",\"path\":\"/reference/logs\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Emits logs attached to a new block that match certain topic filters.\"},{\"title\":\"monadNewHeads\",\"path\":\"/reference/monadnewheads\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Fires a notification each time as soon as a block is Proposed and the node has a chance to speculatively execute.\"},{\"title\":\"monadLogs\",\"path\":\"/reference/monadlogs\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Returns logs (that match a given filter) as soon as the block is Proposed.\"}]},{\"title\":\"Solana Subscription API Endpoints\",\"path\":\"/reference/solana-subscription-api-endpoints\",\"type\":\"section\",\"children\":[{\"title\":\"accountSubscribe\",\"path\":\"/reference/account-subscribe\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to notifications when one Solana account's lamports or data change.\"},{\"title\":\"programSubscribe\",\"path\":\"/reference/program-subscribe\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to notifications for accounts owned by a Solana program.\"},{\"title\":\"logsSubscribe\",\"path\":\"/reference/logs-subscribe\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to Solana transaction log messages that match a log filter.\"},{\"title\":\"signatureSubscribe\",\"path\":\"/reference/signature-subscribe\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to status notifications for one Solana transaction signature.\"},{\"title\":\"rootSubscribe\",\"path\":\"/reference/root-subscribe\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to notifications when the Solana validator sets a new root slot.\"},{\"title\":\"slotSubscribe\",\"path\":\"/reference/slot-subscribe\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to notifications when the Solana validator processes a new slot.\"},{\"title\":\"blockSubscribe\",\"path\":\"/reference/block-subscribe\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to notifications when a new Solana block is confirmed or finalized.\"}]},{\"title\":\"HyperCore Subscription API Endpoints\",\"path\":\"/chains/websockets/hypercore\",\"type\":\"section\",\"children\":[{\"title\":\"Connection lifecycle\",\"path\":\"/chains/websockets/hypercore/connection-lifecycle\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"HyperCore private-preview documentation.\"},{\"title\":\"Replay and recovery\",\"path\":\"/chains/websockets/hypercore/replay-and-recovery\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"HyperCore private-preview documentation.\"},{\"title\":\"Streams\",\"type\":\"section\",\"children\":[{\"title\":\"activeAssetCtx\",\"path\":\"/chains/websockets/hypercore/streams/active-asset-context\",\"type\":\"page\",\"description\":\"HyperCore private-preview documentation.\"},{\"title\":\"allCandles\",\"path\":\"/chains/websockets/hypercore/streams/all-candles\",